<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Saks Holdings reinstated.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Saks Holdings reinstated.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- CS First Boston said it reinstated coverage of Saks Holdings Inc with a strong buy.</p>
<p>-- The stock rose 1/2 to 34.</p>
